.DS_Store

# Build output; a bare `go build ./cmd/arkd` drops the binary at the root
/build/
/arkd

# goreleaser output, from `make release-pricefeed` and snapshot builds
/dist/

# Docker Compose localnet homes, generated by `make localnet-init`
/.testnets/

# Compiled test binaries, left behind by `go test -c` and by profiling runs
*.test

# Fuzz crashers, written by `go test -fuzz`. Promote them to f.Add seeds instead.
**/testdata/fuzz/
